Question 1: Spring Boot Data JPA – Customer and PAN Card
Management System (@OneToOne Bidirectional)
Scenario
A financial organization wants to maintain customer records along with their PAN card details.
Every customer can have only one PAN card, and every PAN card belongs to only one customer.
Develop a Spring Boot application using Spring Data JPA to manage Customer and PAN Card
information by implementing a Bidirectional One-to-One Relationship.
Relationship (HAS-A Relationship)
• Customer HAS-A PAN Card
• One Customer fi One PAN Card
• One PAN Card fi One Customer
• Navigation should be possible from both entities.
• Use: @OneToOne, @JoinColumn, Cascade Operations
