Application Requirements
1. Create Customer and PanCard entity classes.
String
2. Implement HAS-A Relationship using Bidirectional @OneToOne Mapping.
3. Create CustomerRepository and PanCardRepository.
4. Save Customer along with PAN Card details.
5. Fetch Customer details along with associated PAN Card information.
6. Display all Customer records with PAN Card details.
7. Delete Customer and automatically delete associated PAN Card using Cascade operation.
8. Use CommandLineRunner to create objects, establish relationship, save data and retrieve data.
